Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 42/44] i2c: bcm2835: Clear current buffer pointers and counts after a transfer
Date:   Mon, 11 Mar 2019 15:56:58 -0400
Message-Id: <20190311195700.138462-42-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
In-Reply-To: <20190311195700.138462-1-sashal@kernel.org>
